    "Coverage counts use exact Haversine and frozen query inputs; baseline latitude grid row formula was validated over every row with one-cell rounding tolerance.",
    "No baseline application code was copied or executed; SQL scans are coverage measurements, not comparable application latency or answer-quality tests."
